s.t:
Work within an agile team to ensure the quality of complex .NET and Angular based Web and mobile applications;

Test applications in multilingual setup;

Execute functional test scripts and analyze bugs for systems in development;

Perform manual testing on a variety of browsers and operating systems;

Work closely with developers to recognize the potential for any operational issues, assess risks, and resolve issues proactively;

Perform load testing using a variety of tools as per industry standards and suggest solutions for performance issues;

Perform API testing using Postman and similar tools;

Record defect details and create reports outlining the types of defects found and the steps taken to resolve them and update the regression test framework;

Maintain knowledgebase documentation in SharePoint;

Bachelor or Master degree;

6+ years of experience in Quality Assurance for complex web application platforms;

Experience performing manual testing and executing scripted test cases;

Experience with security testing, integration testing, API testing, end-to-end testing, and load testing;

Experience with Mobile application testing, browser compatibility, and accessibility testing experience;

Experience in identifying, analyzing, documenting, and reporting test results;

Experience in writing SQL queries (DQL);

Exposure to JMeter, BlazeMeter;

Exposure to GitLab and CI/CD pipelines;

Exposure to testing multilingual applications;

Good interpersonal skills to work with developers in an agile environment;

ISTQB or similar certification is a plus;

English language proficiency (oral and written);

Define the scope of testing within the context of each product and release by collaborating with Test Engineers, defining test approaches and reviewing and writing test scenarios;
Planning test activities, follow up on progress and approach by ensuring priority alignment inside the team, driving alignment with the involved parties in setting up the environments and tools;
Prepare assessment of the product quality by reviewing requirements, design documentation, creating the test scenarios, test cases and test data including automation of the test cases;
Run assessment of the product quality by running tests and reporting on the outcome;
Continuously assess and look for ways to improve the quality of the product including requirements review and improvement to the testing approach;
Leverage test analysis and test automation patterns to ensure requirement coverage, fast and reliable test execution.

University degree in IT combined with relevant IT professional experience of at least 7 years;
Hands on experience in creating efficient test approaches, test planning, test scenarios, test case creation and execution;
Experience in API testing using Postman, Kreya or similar tools;
Experience using DBs and SQL, containerized solutions and observability tools;
Experience in writing and editing automated tests;
Experience with system integration testing;
Excellent knowledge of testing standards, methods;
Defect Management including prioritization of defects and root cause analysis;
Experience in complex, enterprise system integration;
End User (UAT) management;
Experience with Test and Defect Management tools;
Experience in agile software development and testing methodologies;
Ability to understand business context, define priorities, communicate with technology focused teams and communicate the outcome of test campaigns;
Excellent command of the English language.
